  "permissionYouNeed": "You need: {permission}",
  "fact01": "DID (dissociative identity disorder) affects around 1–2% of people.",
  "fact02": "Everyone in a system can have their own likes, skills and memories.",
  "fact03": "Talking with each other inside is an important step towards stability and healing.",
  "fact04": "Dissociation is a natural way the mind protects itself.",
  "fact05": "Many people with DID function well and lead successful lives.",
  "fact06": "Aurora was built specifically for people in a system to talk with each other.",
  "fact07": "The chat area lets you talk safely inside, without any other app.",
  "fact08": "Every profile can have its own permissions — from full access to a narrow set.",
  "fact09": "The first profile automatically becomes the admin, with every permission.",
  "fact10": "The calendar makes important appointments visible to everyone in the system.",
  "fact11": "In the medication area you can manage both daily and as-needed medications.",
  "fact12": "The finder helps you note down lost things and find them again.",
  "fact13": "The emergency diary records difficult situations for your therapist.",
  "fact14": "Mantras can help you ground yourself during dissociation or stress.",
  "fact15": "In the contacts area you can rate important people and add notes about them.",
  "fact16": "You can pick a colour of its own for every profile.",
  "fact17": "Voice messages let you communicate even when writing is hard.",
  "fact18": "Scribbles in the chat help you show feelings you cannot put into words.",
  "fact19": "Your entries stay on your device. Only what you write in the feedback form is sent.",
  "fact20": "Checking in regularly with everyone inside helps you work together.",
  "fact21": "A shared calendar avoids double bookings and stress.",
  "fact22": "Notes in the emergency diary can be a real help in therapy.",
  "fact23": "Everyone inside may have needs of their own — that is entirely normal.",
  "fact24": "Grounding exercises can help you stay in the here and now.",
  "fact25": "Routines give everyone in the system safety and structure.",
  "fact26": "Breaks matter — for everyone inside, too.",
  "fact27": "You can hide profiles any time and bring them back later.",
  "fact28": "The admin can adjust permissions at any time.",
  "fact29": "As-needed medications can be logged on the spot.",
  "fact30": "In the chat you can address particular people directly.",
  "fact31": "Aurora uses strong encryption for sensitive data.",
  "fact32": "Passwords are never stored in plain text.",
  "fact33": "Resetting a password takes 24 hours, as a safety measure.",
  "fact34": "All chat messages stay private and are stored on the device.",
  "fact35": "Every step towards better communication is a success.",
  "fact36": "It is fine to disagree with each other inside.",
  "fact37": "Working together makes you strong — inside, too.",
  "fact38": "You are not alone — many people live well with DID.",
